# Ignore file for backend/Dockerfile when the build context is the MONOREPO ROOT
# (Railway/Render, and local `docker build -f backend/Dockerfile .`).
#
# BuildKit prefers "<dockerfile>.dockerignore" over the context-root
# ".dockerignore", so this scopes the backend image's context to the backend/
# project without disturbing the root .dockerignore used by the frontend build.
#
# Patterns are relative to the build context (repo root): ignore everything,
# then re-include only the backend project, then prune backend build junk.

*
!backend

backend/.venv
backend/**/__pycache__
backend/.pytest_cache
backend/.ruff_cache
backend/.mypy_cache
backend/tests
backend/.dockerignore
backend/migrations/versions/*.py
